1
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:12,480
Only by making yourself a high-class,

2
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:13,960
tasteful beauty

3
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:15,560
and increasing your value

4
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:18,420
can you have the chance
to attend high-end parties.

5
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:19,520
Shu Roujing,

6
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:21,080
come and demonstrate what I taught you

7
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:22,000
yesterday.

8
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:38,000
This red wine

9
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,160
has a faint sweet taste.

10
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:43,720
Then the aroma will go straight
to your nasal cavity.

11
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:45,920
When drinking...

12
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:47,880
Leave a little on your upper lip.

13
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:50,000
That's the essence.

14
00:01:52,039 --> 00:01:52,800
Great.

15
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:55,289
You truly are the top student
in our class.

16
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,360
Excellent.

17
00:01:58,800 --> 00:01:59,560
One more.

18
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:02,680
Look.

19
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:05,900
Go over there,
and I'll take a picture of you.

20
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:07,680
Chin up a bit.

21
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,940
Straighten your back.

22
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:09,919
Chin up a little higher.

23
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:10,800
Straighten your back.

24
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,400
Hold that bag for a picture too.

25
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,200
Amy,

26
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,280
This one,

27
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,400
and

28
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,240
this one.

29
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:19,120
Remember to post these three on Moments.

30
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:19,720
Remember,

31
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:22,120
make sure to add a classy filter.

32
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,000
It's so shiny.

33
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:54,120
It's so big.

34
00:02:55,079 --> 00:02:56,210
It's blinding me...

35
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,600
Shu Roujing has successfully graduated.

36
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,200
You guys better hurry up.

37
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:02,220
Congratulations.

38
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,680
Don't forget me

39
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,800
when you're rich.

40
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:13,640
Honey,

41
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:15,300
I heard you had a miscarriage.

42
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,770
That's perfect.

43
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,840
The old man was the only one
who wanted this child anyway.

44
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:19,920
Now that it's gone,

45
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:22,140
you're of no use to me anymore.

46
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,290
Let's get a divorce.

47
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,160
Honey,

48
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:27,240
are you really that cruel?

49
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,600
Why would I, He Shi,

50
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:32,800
want a tainted woman?

51
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,520
Especially one

52
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:36,160
who had someone else's dead baby
inside her.

53
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,360
Honey.

54
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,560
Honey.

55
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:42,600
Honey.

56
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:45,200
I don't want a divorce.

57
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,160
Honey.

58
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,520
Honey.

59
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:53,970
I put so much effort into
marrying into the He family.

60
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:57,400
I can't just get divorced like this.

61
00:03:57,480 --> 00:03:58,280
I can't.

62
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,960
Mrs.

63
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,640
He.

64
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:11,120
Please beg He Shi for me.

65
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:14,240
As long as you do what I say.

66
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,240
I'll do whatever you ask me to.

67
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:19,600
Mrs. He, I will definitely obey.

68
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,400
Roujing,

69
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,160
you tell us.

70
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,860
Was it really Li Zhangxin who pushed you?

71
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,520
Zhangxin,

72
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:41,840
I finally managed to climb
the social ladder

73
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,920
through marriage.

74
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:45,400
I can't be kicked out like this.

75
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:46,800
I'm sorry.

76
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,240
Roujing,

77
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,080
how could you...

78
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,840
Just leave.

79
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:00,100
I don't want to see you.

80
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,960
Leave?

81
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,920
Do you think the He family is a place

82
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:07,720
you can come and go as you please?

83
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,240
Accept your punishment.

84
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,880
If it helps the Master cool down,

85
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,540
I'm willing to bear it.

86
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,760
I can't be kicked out before

87
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:29,320
the paternity test results come out.

88
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:31,080
I have already forgiven Li Zhangxin.

89
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:31,720
Please...

90
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,940
I can take the punishment,

91
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,400
but I also have the right
to not admit fault.

92
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:44,480
You can hit me,

93
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:47,120
but I also have the right
to not admit fault.

94
00:05:49,760 --> 00:05:50,280
Dad,

95
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:52,840
Li Zhangxin is the family maid after all.

96
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:54,720
Using family discipline
isn't quite appropriate, is it?

97
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,520
Master,

98
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:57,010
don't go soft on her.

99
00:05:57,159 --> 00:05:59,080
Roujing lost a child,

100
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:01,680
but you lost your eldest grandson.

101
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,600
Stop hitting him.

102
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:33,690
Get out of my way,

103
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,700
or I'll teach you a lesson too.

104
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:37,159
You'll kill him if you keep hitting him.

105
00:06:37,159 --> 00:06:38,159
Get out of the way.

106
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,250
Second Brother.

107
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,040
Are you okay?

108
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:05,960
How are you?

109
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,600
Are you alright?

110
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,360
Second Young Master.

111
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,160
Slow down.

112
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,120
Slow down.

113
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,200
I got some medicine for you.

114
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,400
Remember to apply it.

115
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:23,240
If you still feel unwell,

116
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,370
make sure to tell me.

117
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:26,300
I'll take you to the hospital.

118
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:32,840
When I made mistakes as a kid

119
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,159
and Dad hit me,

120
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,960
my second brother protected me
just like this.

121
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:39,020
Why are you crying?

122
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:45,640
I just suddenly thought
of a brother of mine.

123
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:47,970
He took great care of me, just like you.

124
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:55,920
What you said today

125
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:00,900
is something only Xiaomei would say.

126
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:03,680
So,

127
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:06,720
can you tell me

128
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:08,040
where Xiaomei is now?

129
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:29,440
Sleepy time.

130
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:31,680
This belongs to Xiaomei.

131
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:34,360
Xiaomei asked me to tell you

132
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,690
to wait a little longer.

133
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,360
She'll be back soon.

134
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,320
Okay.

135
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:46,080
Wait a little longer.

136
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:56,620
Thank you all for waiting.

137
00:08:57,280 --> 00:08:59,940
I have an important announcement
to make today.

138
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,720
I went abroad recently

139
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,360
to fulfill

140
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,960
a wish of mine,

141
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:07,930
which was to find
my biological daughter, He Mei.

142
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:11,840
Mei,

143
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,280
come in.

144
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:21,960
Sir,

145
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:24,040
this is truly a blessing in disguise.

146
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:25,280
You lost your eldest grandson,

147
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:27,080
but your daughter has returned.

148
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,360
Mei,

149
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,240
you were only

150
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,370
this tall back then.

151
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,680
Now you've grown into a young woman.

152
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:34,160
You've truly blossomed.

153
00:09:34,520 --> 00:09:35,920
It's good to have you back.

154
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:37,000
Do you still remember me?

155
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,360
I'm Zhang Xin.

156
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,640
Mei,

157
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:47,120
Mei!

158
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,440
Second Brother,

159
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:56,720
You're finally back, Mei.

160
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:58,200
Congratulations,

161
00:09:58,200 --> 00:10:00,120
Master.

162
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:00,960
Wonderful.

163
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:01,760
Okay.

164
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,890
Where did this imposter come from?

165
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,360
You stay here for now.

166
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:28,160
Call me if you need anything.

167
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,960
I'll leave you two to talk.

168
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,360
I won't disturb you.

169
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,080
Second Brother,

170
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:54,080
Mei,

171
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:57,240
Mei,

172
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:59,250
do you still remember this?

173
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:11,280
Looks like you've forgotten.

174
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:13,940
Have a seat.

175
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:15,960
Can you tell me

176
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:17,760
how you've been all these years?

177
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,600
After I got lost,

178
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:21,600
I was adopted by an American couple.

179
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:23,240
They took me abroad.

180
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:26,050
That's why I couldn't
come back all this time.

181
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,530
Did they treat you well?

182
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:28,480
Pretty well.

183
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,200
They really supported me
in finding my family.

184
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,320
That's a relief.

185
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:35,800
Who exactly is He Mei?

186
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:54,520
If He Mei really came back,

187
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:56,720
how could Zhang Xin be so happy?

188
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,000
Come, Mei.

189
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:01,720
Have a seat.

190
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:03,320
How was it?

191
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,560
Did you sleep well last night?

192
00:12:04,560 --> 00:12:05,800
Are you getting used to it?

193
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,440
I am.

194
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:09,240
What are you waiting for?

195
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,040
Come here and wash the feet

196
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:12,240
of our He family's precious daughter.

197
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,410
This looks good.

198
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,810
That one suits you well.

199
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:24,040
By some twist of fate,

200
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:27,170
I, the real daughter,
am washing the feet of the fake one.

201
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,360
Zhang Xin,

202
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:30,040
you are truly ruthless.

203
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:31,620
It looks great.

204
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:34,400
Li Zhangxin.

205
00:12:37,800 --> 00:12:38,600
Why are you...

206
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:40,970
Second Brother,

207
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:43,280
this maid of yours is quite handy.

208
00:12:43,280 --> 00:12:44,720
Can you

209
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:45,920
let me use her too?

210
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:48,530
Second Brother,

211
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,840
I just got back.

212
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,880
Can't you even satisfy

213
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:54,200
this tiny wish of mine?

214
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:56,880
It's fine.

215
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:59,120
The young lady has never been
a young lady before.

216
00:12:59,120 --> 00:13:00,320
Let her get used to it.

217
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:04,960
Wait.

218
00:13:06,880 --> 00:13:08,360
I don't want to use a towel.

219
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:09,960
I want to use

220
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,880
your clothes.

221
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:13,760
Mei,

222
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,250
don't go too far.

223
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:18,240
I remember you being very kind

224
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:19,440
when you were little.

225
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:22,120
I'm sorry, Second Brother.

226
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,520
I didn't mean it.

227
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:28,040
I've just suffered so much over the years.

228
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:32,920
You can have Li Zhangxin,

229
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,800
but she has human rights too.

230
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:35,920
You should respect her,

231
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:36,680
you know?

232
00:13:37,520 --> 00:13:38,600
I know.

233
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:42,840
This He Mei popping out of nowhere

234
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,700
has really messed up all my plans.

235
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:47,400
I must expose her fake identity
as soon as possible.
